{"id": "1620057", "name": "מציאת בסיס לחיתוך וסכום ת\"מ (אחד כספאן ואחד כ NA)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "spanToEq", "params": ["spanMat"], "body": "block(perpSpan:args(nullspace(transpose(spanMat))), eqMat: zeromatrix(1,length(spanMat)), for v in perpSpan do (eqMat: addrow(eqMat, transpose(v))), submatrix(1,eqMat))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>יהיו</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[U=N\\left({{CT:0}}\\right),\\; W=\\text{span}\\left\\{{{CT:1}},{{CT:2}}\\right\\}\\]</p><p>שני תתי מרחבים של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^4\\)</span>.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span></div><p>מצאו בסיס לחיתוך <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(U\\cap W\\)</span> שנסמנו ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B_1\\)</span></p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(B_1=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-veclist\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: וקטורי עמודה בתוך סוגריים מרובעים, מופרדים בפסיקים. למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">[matrix([1],[2],[0]), matrix([0],[1],[3])]</code>.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span></div><p>ומצאו בסיס לסכום <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(U+W\\)</span> שנסמנו ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B_2\\)</span></p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(B_2=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">במידה ואין איברים בבסיס, הזינו את הרשימה הריקה <code dir=\"ltr\">[]</code>. מספר הוקטורים שמופיעים בתבנית התשובה איננו רומז על המספר הנכון. במידה וצריך להוסיף/להוריד וקטורים - הוסיפו/הורידו וקטורים.</p></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]<br>[[feedback:prt2]]<br>", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 45, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "[matrix([?],[?],[?],[?]),matrix([?],[?],[?],[?])]", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 45, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "[matrix([?],[?],[?],[?]),matrix([?],[?],[?],[?])]", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "inW(v) := is(rank(addcol(mat,v)) =2 );\ninU(v) := zeromatrixp(A.v);\nmatSt: matrix([]);\nfor v in ans1 do (matSt:addcol(matSt,v));\n\nflag1: is(length(ans1)=length(intersectionBase)) and is(rank(matSt)=length(intersectionBase));\nif flag1 then for v in ans1 do (if not (inW(v) and inU(v)) then flag1: false);\n\n", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "flag1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b></div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "rkSum:length(sumBase);\nmatSt2: matrix([]);\nfor v in ans2 do (matSt2:addcol(matSt2,v));\nflag2: is(length(ans2)=rkSum) and is(rank(matSt2)=rkSum);\nif flag2 then for v in ans2 do (if not rank(addcol(matv1v2,v))=rkSum then flag2: false);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "flag2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b></div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["A", "eqMat", "intersectionBase", "m", "mat", "matv1v2", "n", "perpSpan", "sumBase", "v1", "v2"], "nvariants": 50}